+ *  @return : - decompressed size of `src` frame content, if known
+ *            - ZSTD_CONTENTSIZE_UNKNOWN if the size cannot be determined
+ *            - ZSTD_CONTENTSIZE_ERROR if an error occurred (e.g. invalid magic number, srcSize too small)
